The keyboard layouts and sizes in this directory (*.json) are generated by tools/latinime-dump from the
AOSP keyboard, LatinIME, as LineageOS ships it (lineage-23.2 for the phone's layouts, lineage-24.0 for the
tablet's): its layout XML, its key texts table and its dimension resources. The keyboard's icons
(../icondata.js) are generated by extension/tools/vd2js.py from the same tree's vector drawables and from two of
frameworks/base core's.

